        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mandaeism</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 100 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Origin</span><span class="info-stat-val">According to the Haran Gawaita, Nasoraean disciples of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/john-the-baptist">John the Baptist</a> left <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a> in the first century CE and settled in southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mesopotamia">Mesopotamia</a>; scholars dispute whether the origin lay in Israel or in Mesopotamia.</span></div>
