asion and the rise in sectarian violence by extremists; by 2007 about 5,000 remain</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">2008</span><span class="rf-text">Mandaeans begin settling in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/worcester">Worcester</a>, Massachusetts, where a community of about 2,500 now lives</span></li></ol>
